questions.promptEn:
Last week you ordered a ceramic tea set from the online shop "HomeStyle Market". When the parcel arrived today, two of the six cups were broken and the teapot was missing completely.

Write an email to the shop's customer service department. In your email:
- say what you ordered and when;
- describe the problems with the delivery;
- explain what action you expect them to take (a refund or a replacement).

Write 120-150 words. Begin your email with "Dear Sir or Madam". Use a formal style.
